{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-5","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If a number be a part of a number, and another be the same part of another, the sum will also be the same part of the sum that the one is of the one.","book":7,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.5/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-5@raw-e993285ef9105e5f","contentId":"euclid-7-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e993285ef9105e5f6faed457ac8adb46bc1e3417b4e5f33312d4ecb0d24df9c8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-5.statement","euclid-7-5.construction.1","euclid-7-5.proof.1","euclid-7-5.construction.2","euclid-7-5.proof.2","euclid-7-5.proof.3","euclid-7-5.proof.4","euclid-7-5.proof.5","euclid-7-5.conclusion","euclid-7-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-5","revisionId":"euclid-7-5@raw-e993285ef9105e5f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"521de1e416804a13de2b1e1a18119209f63a7b830de0e7c387fcce6e002200f6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a number be a part of a number, and another be the same part of another, the sum will also be the same part of the sum that the one is of the one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果数字是数字的一部分,而另一个数字是数字的一部分,那么,总和也是数字的一部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-5","revisionId":"euclid-7-5@raw-e993285ef9105e5f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a0c786037d0a53d09575567e01ddc764625c156dad3551e5ac22a76dc551c3c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the number A be a part of BC, and another, D, the same part of another EF that A is of BC; I say that the sum of A, D is also the same part of the sum of BC, EF that A is of BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A是BC的一部分,D是A是BC的EF也是A的一部分;我说,A,D也是BC,EF是BC的EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-5","revisionId":"euclid-7-5@raw-e993285ef9105e5f","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af15cd08170553a54079a57625a2b44aa3d55d754bae09f8d49a4ad19ffdee46","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, whatever part A is of BC, D is also the same part of EF, therefore, as many numbers as there are in BC equal to A, so many numbers are there also in EF equal to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,无论第A部分是BC,D部分还是EF部分,因此,BC和A的数字一样多,EF和D的数字也一样多。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-5.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-5","revisionId":"euclid-7-5@raw-e993285ef9105e5f","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"840638ac5a5319c453bed2a487315d8df93077454574b040809bf2ac18c3efae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let BC be divided into the numbers equal to A, namely BG, GC, and EF into the numbers equal to D, namely EH, HF; then the multitude of BG, GC will be equal to the multitude of EH, HF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让BC分为A,即BG、GC和EF,即D,即EH、HF;然后BG、GC将等于EH、HF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-5","revisionId":"euclid-7-5@raw-e993285ef9105e5f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"19157d6e3fa173cf2ec5cdaa0ddb575f1d713cf2b46d2407d2116a7558ea170e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BG is equal to A, and EH to D, therefore BG, EH are also equal to A, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG等于A,EH等于D,BG等于BG,EH等于A,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-5","revisionId":"euclid-7-5@raw-e993285ef9105e5f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9eb061ee119799d90438f2087d6af8edbe0385102754440ee8bc64e2bde4be1c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason GC, HF are also equal to A, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,GC,HF也等于A,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-5","revisionId":"euclid-7-5@raw-e993285ef9105e5f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe2bd73304828de37ba1a480fbabe75ce1940f41ef112b5088c26e465ff644ef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as many numbers as there are in BC equal to A, so many are there also in BC, EF equal to A, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BC中的人数相当于A,BC中的人数相当于A,EF中的人数相当于A,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-5.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-5","revisionId":"euclid-7-5@raw-e993285ef9105e5f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9db231cbbfd94ffbd24252b8687e190142cfb116174088f840b5cf3d663085c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, whatever multiple BC is of A, the same multiple also is the sum of BC, EF of the sum of A, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,无论BC的乘数是A, 同一个乘数也是BC,EF, 即A, D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-5.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-5","revisionId":"euclid-7-5@raw-e993285ef9105e5f","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"176cab855eb2790ea32f2d91e44629bb6030a16c2ef417572976e251f69ab297","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, whatever part A is of BC, the same part also is the sum of A, D of the sum of BC, EF. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,无论第A部分是BC部分,同一部分也是BC、EF、Q、E和D总和中的A、D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-5.source","contentId":"euclid-7-5","revisionId":"euclid-7-5@raw-e993285ef9105e5f","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1fe095d6c0ee4eb76934b03694e43df3f3fce194250cec980c2df333ee2ea2d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-6:euclid-7-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-6.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"expl